% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/data_protection/gdpr_procedural_regulation. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% The register commissions NO key: Regulation (EU) 2025/2518 is directly
% applicable and leaves no figure to the Member States. Its figures (the
% application day 2 April 2027 of Art 37(2) and Art 36, the 15 and 12
% months of Art 12(1) and (6) with their extension ceilings of 12 and two
% months, and the sixteen rows of the time-limit table) are values of the
% slice gdpr_procedural_regulation.clausal, each carried with its cite(Key)
% to a citation/2 record in citations.clausal. So this file holds no
% records.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
